**Type:** Headings in **Bricolage Grotesque** (700-800, tight tracking, friendly and slightly quirky). Body and UI in **Instrument Sans** (400-600). Both from Google Fonts. Sentence case everywhere, no all-caps labels.

**Shape and feel:** 20px radius on cards, 999px on buttons and chips, 12px on inputs. Thin 1px borders in #E3E7DE, soft shadow `0 6px 20px rgba(35,75,53,.07)`. Generous whitespace. Motion only when it answers a tap (modal opening, toast, status change).

**Signature element:** the *shelf line*, a rounded 6px forest bar. The hero shows 4 item cards resting on it. It also appears in empty states (a lone item sitting on a shelf line). Use it nowhere else.

**Voice:** Warm, plain, neighborly. "Ask your neighbors" not "Submit a request". Buttons are verbs: "Request to borrow", "Approve", "Confirm return".

